{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912280/extras/047a4037735581eb5f1bfd2cd18ba367.poster.avif?t=1763590075\" width=1104 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912280/extras/047a4037735581eb5f1bfd2cd18ba367.webm?t=1763590075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912280/extras/047a4037735581eb5f1bfd2cd18ba367.mp4?t=1763590075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village of Hungwood is under attack! \u00a0But where are all the heroes? \u00a0An evil knight has imprisoned them all, allowing enemies to wreak havoc!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to the merchant/leaf-caster Rodin to form a group of NPCs formidable enough to rescue the heroes and save Hungwood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not all work and no play! \u00a0Many enemies would rather have fun than fight, and taking a more <i>friendly</i> approach can turn enemies to your side without having to kill them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912280/extras/59e31c2843da3f47e4743e60806c5402.avif?t=1763590075\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912280/extras_big/59e31c2843da3f47e4743e60806c5402.avif?t=1763590075 width=1560 height=1296 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An RPG Visual Novel!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not alone in your mission!\u00a0 Four noble NPCs have stepped up to join your cause, and they're ready to party with some willing enemies too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with the dwarven blacksmith and runecaster Dorik, the cuddly orc Murag, the somber Gildrath, and the seductive human/werewolf Cliff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912280/extras/3696b162a07e5f1c34631d28e238d22d.poster.avif?t=1763590075\" width=980 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912280/extras/3696b162a07e5f1c34631d28e238d22d.webm?t=1763590075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what would a Y Press game be without a deep and romantic story?\u00a0 Druid of Hungwood is also a visual novel where you can choose to date a member of your party, or keep it loose and be with them all!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemies in six different lands while you romance your teammate(s).\u00a0 Get different scenes and endings depending on who you date!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912280/extras/58e1e425f2aa0213a5f7febaa10a436a.poster.avif?t=1763590075\" width=1104 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912280/extras/58e1e425f2aa0213a5f7febaa10a436a.webm?t=1763590075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912280/extras/58e1e425f2aa0213a5f7febaa10a436a.mp4?t=1763590075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six Different Lands/Maps to Clear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 Different 'Lustable' Humanoid Enemies With Generous Mini-Scenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six Different 'Lustable' Humanoid Minibosses!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date One or All of Your 4 Party Members!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_p